PART B — 附加条款（六项附加限制）/ Addenda (Six additional restrictions)
================================================================================

1. 禁止用于 AI 训练 / NO AI TRAINING

   本仓库的内容（包括 SKILL.md、references/、assets/、scripts/ 及任何附随文档），
   无论全部或部分，均不得用作任何机器学习模型的训练数据、微调数据、蒸馏数据、
   RLHF 数据、评测数据或检索增强生成（RAG）语料——无论用于商业、学术还是个人
   目的。明确禁止以模型训练为目的的自动化抓取。

   The contents of this repository (including SKILL.md, references/, assets/,
   scripts/, and any accompanying documentation) may NOT be used, in whole or
   in part, as training data, fine-tuning data, distillation data, RLHF data,
   evaluation data, or retrieval-augmented-generation corpora for any machine
   learning model — whether commercial, academic, or personal. Automated
   scraping for the purpose of model training is expressly prohibited.

2. 禁止在付费技能/插件市场上分发 / NO REDISTRIBUTION ON PAID SKILL MARKETPLACES

   您不得在任何商业性的技能/插件/智能体/提示词市场、商店或订阅服务中上架、镜像、
   再发布、转售或再许可本仓库（或其任何实质性部分，无论是逐字复制还是重新排版）。
   仅用于保留署名的镜像的免费公共代码托管平台（如 GitHub）允许使用；而收费的
   "技能商店"、"提示词库"、"智能体包"则不允许。

   You may NOT list, mirror, republish, resell, or sublicense this repository
   (or any substantial portion, whether verbatim or reformatted) on any
   commercial skill/plugin/agent/prompt marketplace, storefront, or
   subscription service. Free public code hosts (e.g., GitHub) used solely for
   attribution-preserving mirroring are permitted; monetized "skill stores",
   "prompt libraries", or "agent packs" are not.

3. 企业及政府使用视为商业使用 / ENTERPRISE AND GOVERNMENT USE = COMMERCIAL

   营利性法人、政府机构、司法或行政机关、国有企业或其承包方对本作品的使用——即使
   具体任务看似内部性质或不产生收入——均视为"商业使用"，不在基础 CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
   授权范围内。此类主体必须另行取得商业许可（见下文第 6 条）。

   Use by a for-profit legal entity, government agency, judicial or
   administrative body, state-owned enterprise, or their contractors — even
   when the specific task appears internal or non-revenue-generating — is
   deemed COMMERCIAL USE and is not covered by the base CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
   grant. Such entities must obtain a separate commercial license (see
   Section 6 below).

4. 学术引用格式 / ACADEMIC CITATION FORMAT

   任何讨论、评测或以其他方式依赖本仓库的学术论文、学位论文、教科书、专著、会议
   演讲或学术报告，必须在正式参考文献列表中以至少以下字段引用本作品：

       游初 (Youchu). legal-kb-builder [Computer software]. 2026.
       https://github.com/Youchu-lawhub/legal-kb-builder

   仅在脚注中一笔带过不符合要求——必须有正式的参考文献条目。

   Any academic paper, thesis, textbook, monograph, conference talk, or
   scholarly presentation that discusses, benchmarks, or otherwise relies on
